    w: 1, title: "What Is Prayer?", theme: "Prayer is talking and listening to God as his children, in a relationship he began",
    summary: "Prayer is one of the first things a new believer is asked to do and one of the hardest to keep doing. This opening lesson defines prayer from Scripture, shows that it is a relationship before it is a method, and removes some common misunderstandings.",
    scripture: ["Psalm 145:18-19", "Matthew 6:5-8"], more: ["Philippians 4:6-7", "Luke 18:1-8", "Hebrews 11:6"], memory: "Psalm 145:18",
