    teacher: "Some learners have painful experiences of fathers, and some have no father at all. Handle with great sensitivity. Do not assume that fatherhood language is easy for everyone. Reassure them that Jesus reveals the true Father, and be ready to listen privately to anyone who needs to talk.",
